# LOAD-BEARING. The Dockerfile does `COPY . /opt/bridge`, so these exclusions
# are the only thing keeping a Robinhood password or a live session out of a
# published image layer. Anything added to this folder that holds a secret must
# be listed below. Treat every edit to this file as a security change.

.git

# Secrets and live state. Live on the host at /state, never in the image.
.env
.env.*
credentials.env
credentials.env.*
.tokens
reauth_inbox
task_inbox
data

# Anything else that could hold a secret or account data.
*.pickle
*.pkl
*.pem
*.bak
*.log
*.json
credentials*

# Personal notes and scratch text next to a live checkout. requirements.txt
# is the one .txt the build needs.
*.txt
!requirements.txt

.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc

# Docs don't affect the build.
*.md
